	NextArmor: Next: +{0} (+{1} defense, +{2} Luck)
	Cost: Cost per try:
	Chance: Success chance: {0}%
	Upgrade: Upgrade
	BoostOff: Boost: off
	BoostOn: Boost: ON (x2, +15%)
