	Working: Upgrading...
	Success: Success! The item is now +{0}.
	Fail: Failed. The materials are gone, the item is unharmed.
	Maxed: This item is fully upgraded.
	NoMaterials: Not enough materials.
	NoMoney: Not enough coins for the fee.
	NotUpgradeable: Only Gambler weapons and armor can be upgraded.
